<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Fleet xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <Name>Bronze Wing</Name>
  <Version>3</Version>
  <TotalPoints>3000</TotalPoints>
  <FactionKey>KUIPER/kuiper</FactionKey>
  <Description>Difficulty: &lt;color=yellow&gt;MODERATE&lt;/color&gt;
Bronze Wing "Volitile Times", is a close range brawling wing. The twin Vesperas of "Fire and Whispers" and "Dance With Me" mount 500mm Seige guns. Capable of engaging any target with anti cruiser and above with HESH rounds that burn off armour and heavily damage internals. Or with HE-B (bombshell) rounds able to damage whole formations of corvettes and destroyers, as well as sevice-able effect into light cruisers. Dual purpose castle turrets suppliment the limited goalkeeper CIWS on the right of the Vesperas as well as being able to deal significant damage with Frag rounds on ships stripped of armour by HESH. Supporting the Vesperas are two kyves. One a jamming escort to cover Bronze wing as it moves to engage. The other a standalone spotter able to help Bronze wing decide to engage.

Bronze wing rewards picking targets that are out of position and manipulating angles to rapidly disable and kill ships that can't be supported by other ships, as well as staying nimble and avoiding overcommiting.
 </Description>
  <SortOverrideOrder>6</SortOverrideOrder>
  <ModDependencies>
    <unsignedLong>3649434947</unsignedLong>
  </ModDependencies>
